@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+# Production monitoring
+
+RouteHub uses optional, dependency-free Sentry HTTP reporting so the web app and Supabase Edge Functions can share one project without adding a runtime SDK to the PWA.
+
+## Variables
+
+- `NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN`: Sentry DSN exposed to the browser (Vercel Production, Preview and Development as appropriate).
+- `SENTRY_DSN`: Sentry DSN for Edge Functions (Supabase Edge Function secrets). Keep this value private.
+
+If the variables are absent, reporting is disabled and the app continues normally. Replace the placeholder support address in the UI with the real support mailbox.
+
+The client captures uncaught errors and unhandled promise rejections. `lib/error-reporting.ts` also forwards operational catches, and both current Edge Functions report their top-level failures. Do not include access tokens, service-role keys, photos or customer secrets in event context.
